# CI and environment

- Toolchain pins: `gradle/libs.versions.toml` and `docs/build-plan.md` §4 (compileSdk/targetSdk 36, AGP 8.9.1, Gradle 8.11.1).
- After adding or regenerating `gradlew`, ensure executable bit for Linux CI: `git update-index --chmod=+x gradlew`.
- PR status check that blocks merge: CI job **`verify`** only. **`instrumented`** is a placeholder until U13.
- Local Android builds need `local.properties` with `sdk.dir` (gitignored). CI uses `android-actions/setup-android`.
- Do not commit `google-services.json`, API keys, or secrets.
